{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "6171f9ef65a1693cefaa7b395c1e9b766ab99666797d771f8867538370e1104a", "ja": "レッツゴー☆しほりん捜索隊", "zh": "出发☆志保凛搜查队", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "afb6f91a7719edea3d0a4d02cd5ade9f926d629f6923eb8920b8b87e851cbd79", "ja": "撮影は順調だが、ふと志保が姿を消してしま\nう。心配するアイドル達。茜とエレナは捜索\n隊を結成し、志保をおびき寄せるためのプリ\nンを用意する。その後、無事に帰ってきた、\n志保から話を聞くことに。", "zh": "拍摄进展顺利，但志保却突然消失  \n偶像们都很担心。茜和艾蕾娜组成搜寻队，为了引诱志保现身准备了布丁。  \n之后，听取了平安归来的  \n志保的说明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "85521ef6b8b923139566e2ac16d2252836319bd9cbe365ed0a9e3ed6d6e04ade", "ja": "（『誰ソ彼ノ淵』の撮影は順調に進んでいる。\nみんなの演技にも、磨きがかかってきているようだ）", "zh": "（《谁彼之渊》的拍摄进展顺利。大家的演技似乎也越来越精湛了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "251e5971698dd530c7e7038e08788c70db905495612d1c1d4b1e687e3e7daae6", "ja": "（今日の撮影は、食事の後……女主人とメイド、\nそして先生が食卓で会話をするシーンだ）", "zh": "（今天的拍摄将在用餐后进行……这是女主人、女仆和老师在餐桌旁交谈的场景）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "ca74b8f7dd0a4f1a80a990006f7e630ebbb8a434710ab406ccfc3188e209d743", "ja": "今日の食事も悪くなかったわ、志保。\n……そういえば、あの子の様子はどうかしら？", "zh": "今天的饭菜也还不错，志保。\n……说起来，那孩子最近怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "887408fcdfc0ce749106329d5c992947c79cf2321cb398ec35bfe6cf852582d2", "ja": "はい。お嬢様に、変わった様子はございません。\n朝は、敷地の中を、散歩なさっていました。", "zh": "是的。小姐没有什么异常。\n\n早上，她还在宅邸里散了会儿步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "e7a979f912e4ba474716f3e3141198608ee90513eaebaf6f3423e45bb70f8465", "ja": "まあ……！　そう、あの子が外に……\nうふっ。うふふふふっ。", "zh": "哎呀……！是吗，那孩子出门去了……\n呵呵。呵呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "f92a684a6954a3da75b8e210dc4e60cf0518a0deec2558f3f592521c10742d66", "ja": "……？　あの……。", "zh": "……？那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "a48b2a46a3a0de6507f5471361bc2f138be563ccf1466f7edfb6b166eb303234", "ja": "あら……ふふっ。お客様の前でごめんなさいね。\nあの子、体が弱くて、あまり外に出ないものですから。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵。让您在客人面前见笑了。\n那孩子身体不太好，平时不怎么出门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "1cfe08d776123011b0fa454f7070fe25363a30fd980734f95fd8970797aeae75", "ja": "そうでしたか。けど、適度な運動は体にいいですし、\n日に当たったほうが気持ちも明るくなりますから……。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，适度运动有益身体健康，而且晒晒太阳心情也会变得开朗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "bc266103ca479d9543d4ce340c06f6beb5ac238af9f4dd088b4ee3efac49a7fe", "ja": "ええ。久しぶりのお客様で不安もありましたけど、\n杞憂だったみたいですわ。……それより、歌織先生。", "zh": "是的。虽然久违地迎来客人，让我有些不安，\n但现在看来好像是我杞人忧天了。……比起这个，歌织老师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "2bec536ab4f565bc04dab5639a485125cd96a5b59cff722e0261f640c2972e44", "ja": "貴女は、大丈夫かしら……？", "zh": "您没事吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "312630bb294472dae3ba591f94b76e4fc8080cc6f4a3bdb5e4afc7e1c848470e", "ja": "えっ？　私……ですか？", "zh": "诶？我……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "8aa59472e515316be158d7cfc62deb4a50556ecfc978fbb80d9684902a58fde1", "ja": "そうよ。律子さん……といったかしら？\n行方がわからなくなってしまったでしょう？", "zh": "是啊。好像是叫律子小姐……对吧？\n她已经下落不明了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "87ea88b083b2a5293f290bfb14d06c2973be901ad8c7716d5945562c0977eddd", "ja": "そうですね……。でも、大丈夫です。\n律子ちゃんは、きっと帰ってきますから……。", "zh": "是啊……不过，没关系。\n律子一定会回来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3b4b3ffa0fe6296fb372e230cf6845e7b45667d6c30c6201adc81b51e9eb04bd", "ja": "（女主人と先生の、緊張感あるやりとりが続く。\n……うん、今のシーンもよかったな）", "zh": "（女主人和老师之间紧张的对话仍在继续。\n……嗯，刚才的场景也不错啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1015_staff", "source_sha256": "73541127f0bbd61fc276d7bc608cb515052747be131aa4ce288cbfdfe85db8d8", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　映像チェックに入るので、\n少しお待ちください！", "zh": "辛苦了！我们要开始检查影像了，请稍等片刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8ffe908817d89000962a49be94e51ccbb14cdc00ac9fe0ef3ab28069e1d20f27", "ja": "歌織さん、千鶴さん、お疲れ様です！\nあれ、志保は……？", "zh": "歌织、千鹤，辛苦了！\n咦，志保呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "af8ad00c6dce753a1fd00a6312d6167cbf7eeed7cd4fd353096b89a65759b16a", "ja": "あら？　志保ちゃん、\nさっきまで一緒にいたはずなんですけど……。", "zh": "哎呀？志保刚才明明还和我在一起的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "a60e1d79ed6a20824d97476fc1f9f1bfcca77818943aefe8e4b8daf71dd987d6", "ja": "志保なら、撮影が終わってすぐに\n出て行きましたわよ？", "zh": "志保的话，拍摄刚结束\n就出去了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "93be7f86043ac94610a351d34073361074adc87e088d0b8b39cadf0b43016ba5", "ja": "えっ、もう？　……部屋に戻ったのかな。", "zh": "咦，已经走了吗？……是回房间了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "04df919f5ede86a7ecb9213b5fa53b7782731744996637e9abfbb6a465176f9b", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n志保ちゃんのことなんですけど……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n是关于志保的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "17bf9ffa68cfe0ffaccc52a962c605daac1cbfcf4fbb9d7aa825f2375bdebca5", "ja": "志保がどうかしましたか？", "zh": "志保她怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "28d5f51fb28fb38123082da5fcbba02e31c2999e2c82b521e9b41528d298488e", "ja": "なんだかすこし、思いつめているように見えて……\n私の、思いすごしならいいんですけど。", "zh": "总觉得她好像有点钻牛角尖……\n如果只是我想多了就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "03829eaed219078c71990acf9011f9cb7244eb227a91440ccbaf77b106a11d36", "ja": "言われてみれば……普段以上に、\n人を避けているようにも見えますわね。", "zh": "您这么一说……确实，她好像比平时更加回避与人接触呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d3ae9949366270fe59d476b5a3d9e16d7890818ded244e8826ee9782bd7d10c3", "ja": "そうでしたか。\nもしかして、演技の事で悩んでるのかな……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n难道她是在为演技的事烦恼吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "1bf868379c58362c588b853de39b6bf56458dab3f3740612bea77a1b326e4968", "ja": "志保は繊細ですし、今回、難しい役柄ですものね。\nもう……わたくしに一言相談してくれてもいいのに。", "zh": "志保心思细腻，而且这次的角色又很有难度呢。\n真是的……明明跟我商量一句也是可以的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "a1695eadd04174c6b4d0c7304d969fbd45341cd6c2596b300fb0484fc4d85dcf", "ja": "話は聞かせてもらったー！", "zh": "事情我都听说啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "4841db0043f0c21e25e9cac99b58e2686a483302d63d9794c85612879a50090a", "ja": "もらったヨー！", "zh": "听到了唷——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "76d806084d8ace6b2d36191c062018bcaaf2c8e9f7600d1ea1858caaae1d2e77", "ja": "あ、茜ちゃん？　エレナちゃんも……。", "zh": "啊，小茜？艾莉娜也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "bc9b060665c023c7cc3065fd2af7c285d4cb4875c818dd1677c97eed7eef5df0", "ja": "そういうことなら、今すぐ！　茜ちゃんと\nエレナちゃんが、しほりんを探してきてあげる！", "zh": "既然这样，现在就去！　小茜和艾蕾娜去把志保找回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "b1e033097c3984c15de2dba7a575818e53e19e9479568cb96bfe291f662e62d7", "ja": "ワタシもアカネと一緒に行くヨー！\nシホ、なんとなく元気ないかもって思ってたから……。", "zh": "我也要和茜一起去——！\n因为我觉得志保好像有点没精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "e77be4900b7e241268a16461e3c898fc2af6d0f2baa9950241b55c44b03716fd", "ja": "打ち合わせの時は普通に見えたんだけどな……\nわかった、俺も一緒に探そう。", "zh": "开会时看起来还挺正常的……\n知道了，我也一起去找。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "6133d35a001a5e518a6e2ce2ad816142ca03d585ee7108d099a59cb35b996eff", "ja": "さすが{$P$}ちゃん、わかってるね！\nそれじゃあ、しほりん捜索隊、しゅっぱーつ！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}，真懂我！\n那么，志保搜寻队，出发——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "12fa60a7149d4732a66d1ccaaa097f9a1f5602c0f4caf68167c044dccfca1426", "ja": "イェーイ！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "6d8ba2bca602c7ede6791624747af982f35f5ce6644c5e0ea2ba784bce25143f", "ja": "ではまず最初に、プリンをつくりまーす！", "zh": "那么首先，先来做布丁——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "4161d930e824ad72ad784a2d87b8199c956275d53b3292a820a70fdd64bc32c2", "ja": "ハーイ♪", "zh": "嗨～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "10be68730d0ad1cc6388aecb96751743442cb24d8408c9cd1c907caf62d11a69", "ja": "待て待て。なんでプリンなんだ！？\nというか、志保は普通に部屋にいるんじゃないのか？", "zh": "等等等等。为什么是布丁啊！？\n话说回来，志保不就普通地待在房间里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "15b237ceb3278700d69c38dd7011bacf5f58c0da7c472c7912791c76647b30c5", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん。ただ普通に\n部屋に行って、しほりんが出てきてくれると思う？", "zh": "{$P$}。你觉得就这么直接去房间，志保会出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "6bef365f088453ccb8da7ba3b2903ede22ec728a9a85b3ef54942d94940566cf", "ja": "だから、プリンをエサに誘い出すんだよ！\nニオイにつられてやってきたところを……ガバッと！", "zh": "所以，要用布丁当诱饵把她引出来啊！\n等她被香味吸引过来的时候……猛地扑上去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "830b086d43b901936152641b745a230f6ad4b1141beb4d25e20cf106b1e6e460", "ja": "いや、茜じゃあるまいし……。というか、\nもしかして茜がプリンを食べたいだけじゃないか？", "zh": "不，人家又不是茜……话说回来，\n该不会只是茜自己想吃布丁了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "9b914d155b6f5ec3f46c4a1ec128cd12f27ecda4729a75a06989e2ce8344a4cd", "ja": "うん、そうとも言うね！　だって\nここに来てから、プリンのプの字もないんだよ～？", "zh": "嗯，也可以这么说呢！因为\n自从来到这里之后，连布丁的影子都看不到啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "ef0551ffe33e80c4376b464110d8fe1186f6a5c3af3d797e7f14dcb8e97a6d03", "ja": "ねーねー、アカネー。\nワタシ、プリン作ったことないけど大丈夫カナ？", "zh": "喂喂，茜。我从来没做过布丁，这样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "6b49877616aa6e3224daeb653acf0c046fa39ed5887fcaa8649949c96cd11ee9", "ja": "だいじょーぶ♪　レシピサイトを検索すると……ほら！\n簡単につくれて、おいしいプリンのレシピが！", "zh": "没问题♪ 搜索食谱网站的话……看！\n有简单又美味的布丁食谱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "70b851ab58710c733ac922190135654fc322dfa460daf3da105c6ac452b84a80", "ja": "それじゃ、クッキングスタート！\nワタシは、フライパンでお湯をわかすヨー。", "zh": "那么，开始做饭吧！\n我来用平底锅烧水哦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "3ed0fc3ac24baaf76c6a1cf002a7350004b459fbc75deb2ef9d84ebe7952800f", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、ボールに卵と砂糖を入れて……。", "zh": "小茜把鸡蛋和砂糖放进碗里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "439a70bf4b81179599457af91881eb32e6ace884f265e47169e562ad5e35ac91", "ja": "（まあ、茜にも何か考えがあるのかもしれない……。\nここは少し様子をみてみよう）", "zh": "（不过，茜或许也有自己的想法……这里还是先观察一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "f780f9edc6c90250c369df56353471a9bd2f7821cf74f470d8b50e00c29b5c4f", "ja": "おお……ちゃんとしたプリンができてる……！", "zh": "哦……居然做出了像样的布丁……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "66bd871cda8f3009e7aefde01a685a38c5bc428be41dd9b5ea6bc95f819a9692", "ja": "おいしいプリンの完成なのだー！\nそれじゃあ、しほりん探しの旅にしゅっぱーつ！", "zh": "美味的布丁完成啦——！\n那么，寻找志保凛的旅程，出发——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1048_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1050_023aka", "source_sha256": "52aa5342c5c352b4267727246ff81d6f04545798011204e490b5238c010fc6a3", "ja": "おお！　ナイスタイミングだよ、しほりん！\n茜ちゃん達と一緒に、プリン食べない？", "zh": "哇！来得正是时候，小志保！\n要不要和小茜一起吃布丁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "3ab3920f846588fc7853dbeb7db3948fdcaba3f8eecc26e660db37677e054b25", "ja": "プリン？\n……いえ、けっこうです。", "zh": "布丁？\n……不用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1052_023aka", "source_sha256": "cd3033b5ddb6f57380964d3eda59f1168eaeeaedfcb730bc10659dadc3014f8a", "ja": "ナンデ！？", "zh": "为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "707e4e8a8f2c6e75f89a1bcb3679e27c10b83b7549a6ab60d1d88ad85fe84bb9", "ja": "なんでと言われても……特にお腹も空いてませんし。\n甘いものを食べたい気分でもないですから。", "zh": "就算你问我为什么……我也不知道该怎么说……\n我也不是特别饿。\n而且现在也没有想吃甜食的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1054_018ele", "source_sha256": "ba5bec7457cbc0fc6150e028312da209033561a98e9d19e91a05d75799987a92", "ja": "ねえシホ、これ、アカネとワタシが作ったんだヨ。\nすーっごくおいしそうでしょ？　ちょっとだけ、ダメ？", "zh": "呐，志保，这个是我和茜一起做的哦。\n看起来超——好吃的吧？就一点点，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1055_033sih", "source_sha256": "fa8052161bb48cd17ca238e0de93921aeacf9b6243317c24d4e5e7b541076e9d", "ja": "ダメというか……。", "zh": "也不能说不行，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1056_p", "source_sha256": "f09fc2f599758b93fd5834f89f1a4c74d8c5ba395ef96421a3ce1987cec7f555", "ja": "志保、食べたくなければ無理に食べなくていいから……\nその代わり、少し話がしたいんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "志保，不想吃的话，不用勉强自己……\n不过，我想和你聊一会儿，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1057_033sih", "source_sha256": "7fe152f43c4ffaf822c4cad3078859f3e3042aeb5bec6a1be4b84c46d4ee7800", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\nその話って、お仕事に関係あることですか？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。\n您说的事，和工作有关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1058_p", "source_sha256": "204678afed220f704ce37378e0a178404e8be937e80470814c84d5e8d3c96a1f", "ja": "もちろん。頼めないかな？", "zh": "当然了。可以拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1059_033sih", "source_sha256": "77369cb4ddc9b737c6a7c57448fd0abab6031d7a79633e08cdfad25bd4168649", "ja": "そうですか……わかりました。\nなら、付き合います。", "zh": "是这样啊……我明白了。\n那我就奉陪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1060_018ele", "source_sha256": "86d9f2d33f67a4014dc594a940f9b39693cb07f4f9afca8c3abf65967581da36", "ja": "やったネ、アカネ！", "zh": "太好啦，茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1061_023aka", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_04_1062_p", "source_sha256": "914437fc68625c033f2377319370ca3972f40f503ca0f61cddd05df3b6cf32c2", "ja": "（茜の作戦は、あまり効果がなかったようだ。\nさて、志保の悩みが聞き出せるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（茜的作战好像没什么效果。接下来要是能问出志保的烦恼就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
